Relevant columns and potential usage
• PUBLICATIONS."family_id": identify patent families; filter out rows where the value equals '-1' and aggregate counts.  
• PUBLICATIONS."publication_number": join key that uniquely identifies a publication; use to link with ABS_AND_EMB.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."publication_number": join key on the abstract table.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."abstract": text field that may hold the abstract we need; filter for non‑empty entries.  
Optional / helper columns for exploration  
• PUBLICATIONS."country_code", PUBLICATIONS."publication_date": sanity‑check, sampling, or further filtering.  

