       "publication_number",
       "country_code",
       "publication_date"
FROM PATENTS_GOOGLE.PATENTS_GOOGLE.PUBLICATIONS
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- Description: Examine distinct values of family_id (excluding the placeholder -1) to see format/size.
